{"id":"n63256-1-9","stage":3,"title":"설사 · 腹泻","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n63256-1-9-1","ko":"지난번에 다녀가신 뒤에는 대변을 잘 보시나요?","zh":"上次您去过后，排便情况还好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지난번에","meaning":"上次，上回","explanation":"지난번：上次，上回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"지난번","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71316","senseId":"1","lemma":"지난번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지난번에","audio":"/audio/00bddae7b7dbaea35dd2.mp3"}},{"text":"다녀가신","meaning":"来过，到过","explanation":"다녀가다：来过，到过；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다녀가다","audio":"/audio/b752b475a0c6e66fea4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64528","senseId":"1","lemma":"다녀가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다녀가신","audio":"/audio/efc0c1a72333198aa9de.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤에는","meaning":"后，之后，后来","explanation":"뒤：后，之后，后来；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"뒤","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67477","senseId":"2","lemma":"뒤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤에는","audio":"/audio/8ec318eeb31b95855f70.mp3"}},{"text":"대변을","meaning":"大便","explanation":"대변：大便；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대변","audio":"/audio/8716c9c0a56fd53c3ec9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57954","senseId":"1","lemma":"대변","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대변을","audio":"/audio/e344214fa3752679bb6a.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"보시나요?","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보시나요","audio":"/audio/aa35074754630e3a7479.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"0c2f1df517822c1f","term":"지난번","zh":"上次，上回","audio":"/audio/0c2f1df517822c1fb603.mp3","entryId":"71316","definition":"以正在说话时为准，指过去的时候。","pronunciation":["지난번"]},{"id":"b752b475a0c6e66f","term":"다녀가다","zh":"来过，到过","audio":"/audio/b752b475a0c6e66fea4a.mp3","entryId":"64528","definition":"来到某地后又离开。","pronunciation":["다녀가다"]},{"id":"c65326b2de936236","term":"뒤","zh":"后，之后，后来","audio":"/audio/c65326b2de936236c222.mp3","entryId":"67477","definition":"在时间或顺序上，以后或下次。","pronunciation":["뒤ː"]},{"id":"8716c9c0a56fd53c","term":"대변","zh":"大便","audio":"/audio/8716c9c0a56fd53c3ec9.mp3","entryId":"57954","definition":"(文雅)人的屎。","pronunciation":["대ː변"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9140f19307b892fe804a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n63256-1-9-2","ko":"아니요. 약을 먹었더니 오히려 설사가 심해졌어요.","zh":"不好。吃了药之后，腹泻反而更严重了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아니요.","meaning":"不是，不用","explanation":"아니요：不是，不用","readings":[{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17189","senseId":"1","lemma":"아니요","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니요","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3"}},{"text":"약을","meaning":"药","explanation":"약：药；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"약","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72379","senseId":"1","lemma":"약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"약을","audio":"/audio/f745a64b3ad605aada03.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었더니","meaning":"服，吃","explanation":"먹다：服，吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더니：根据先前观察的情况，引出后来的变化、结果或对比。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"3","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었더니","audio":"/audio/11f25c19571a122b3706.mp3"}},{"text":"오히려","meaning":"却，反而","explanation":"오히려：却，反而","readings":[{"term":"오히려","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22037","senseId":"1","lemma":"오히려","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오히려","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3"}},{"text":"설사가","meaning":"腹泻，拉肚子，稀屎","explanation":"설사：腹泻，拉肚子，稀屎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"설사","audio":"/audio/8fa2ea8c585abe4701de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63256","senseId":"1","lemma":"설사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"설사가","audio":"/audio/6fd1c915d93dbb5fae19.mp3"}},{"text":"심해졌어요.","meaning":"严重；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"심하다：严重；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态。；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"심하다","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65046","senseId":"1","lemma":"심하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"심해졌어요","audio":"/audio/f3143cf6e27e09875f02.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9474acc7539b7e2c","term":"아니요","zh":"不是，不用","audio":"/audio/9474acc7539b7e2cedaf.mp3","entryId":"17189","definition":"用于否定回答长辈所提出的问题。","pronunciation":["아니요"]},{"id":"2a9db5dfd1480367","term":"약","zh":"药","audio":"/audio/2a9db5dfd1480367dc36.mp3","entryId":"72379","definition":"为了治疗、预防病患或伤口，服用、抹、注射的物质。","pronunciation":["약"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"服，吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将药物放进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"b499084b40ea381f","term":"오히려","zh":"却，反而","audio":"/audio/b499084b40ea381f8c7f.mp3","entryId":"22037","definition":"与通常预期或期待相反或不同地。","pronunciation":["오히려"]},{"id":"8fa2ea8c585abe47","term":"설사","zh":"腹泻，拉肚子，稀屎","audio":"/audio/8fa2ea8c585abe4701de.mp3","entryId":"63256","definition":"消化食物的肠道发生异常，大便呈水状；或指那样的大便。","pronunciation":["설싸"]},{"id":"a1212e5a4cc18554","term":"심하다","zh":"严重","audio":"/audio/a1212e5a4cc185542567.mp3","entryId":"65046","definition":"程度过头。","pronunciation":["심ː하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/fe07be8f6df507a0eae3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.989,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=63256","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7143,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["不好。吃了药之后，腹泻反而更严重了。","隐形眼镜引起了过敏，我刚去看了眼科。","上次您去过后，排便情况还好吗？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["不好。吃了药之后，腹泻反而更严重了。","上次您去过后，排便情况还好吗？","隐形眼镜引起了过敏，我刚去看了眼科。"],"answer":0}]}
